          "heading": "Former England international set to make Fiji Test debut against France",
          "body": "Fiji's next assignment is at Groupama Stadium in Lyon, where Jake White's side face France on Saturday. Reports say a former England international is set to win a first Fiji cap in the match. It is Fiji's fourth Nations Championship game: the three July defeats, including 39-24 to Wales and 73-8 to England, came under interim coach Senirusi Seruvakula, before White was appointed."
