          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "George Furbank recalled at full-back as Borthwick names England side for Australia",
          "body": "Fin Smith has been declared fit after an injury scare in the build-up, and Planet Rugby reports he has started England's past five matches at fly-half. George Furbank is back on the team sheet at full-back, having been kept out of the Test side since November 2024 by injuries and an appendicitis bout in the July window; the report calls him in strong form at Harlequins. Greg Fisilau is in the matchday squad and in line for a maiden Test cap."
