          "body": "Esteban Capilla was named in France's matchday 23 for Saturday's France v Fiji in Lyon, and RTÉ Sport reports he could make his debut off the bench. He earned his place after Oscar Jegou was injured on Wednesday. Antoine Dupont captains the side from scrum-half, partnering Romain Ntamack at half-back, while Louis Bielle-Biarrey starts on the wing."
