          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Captain Dan Sheehan forced off after failed head assessment against Argentina",
          "body": "Against Argentina on Friday night, Dan Sheehan was forced off in the first half after failing a head injury assessment, and head coach Andy Farrell said the captain \"seems fine in the dressing room\". Robert Baloucoune also went off with a knock in the 58th minute, while Sean Jansen sustained a \"bang\" to his knee. Josh van der Flier and Mack Hansen both have ankle concerns, with Hansen continuing after treatment."
