          "kicker": "Captain's admission",
          "heading": "Sione Tuipulotu takes full responsibility for Scotland's second-half collapse against New Zealand",
          "body": "Scotland captain Sione Tuipulotu has put the blame on himself for the 43-21 defeat, saying the side were \"nowhere near accurate enough\" in the second half. Tuipulotu was sin-binned on 50 minutes as Scotland conceded 13 penalties to New Zealand's eight, and New Zealand scored three tries after the interval without reply. \"Our discipline wasn't good enough, and it starts with me,\" he said, adding that Scotland now face a \"must-win game\" against Australia next week."
        },
