          "heading": "Justo Piccardo and Efraín Elías yellow-carded in Dublin defeat to Ireland",
          "body": "Justo Piccardo was sin-binned for offside on 34 minutes while defending near the try zone, leaving Argentina a man short, and Efraín Elías followed for a high tackle on Hugo Keenan later in the match. Rónan Kelleher's lineout maul for Ireland's sixth try came against a seven-man Pumas pack. The cards compounded the loss of captain Julián Montoya, who failed a head injury assessment before half-time and did not return."
        },
