          "body": "Sam Greene and Seung-sin Lee are injured, and Ryunosuke Ito, who started all of Japan's Tests this year, is back at university and misses the whole tour. Eddie Jones opted to start Honda Heat's uncapped Riku Kitahara at fly-half, with Toyota's Shinya Komura, who won his last of three caps against Georgia in November 2025, on the bench as the only other option. Japan lost 21-28 to Wales in Cardiff on Saturday."
