          "heading": "Beauden Barrett's brace helps All Blacks beat Scotland 43-21 at Murrayfield",
          "body": "New Zealand scored seven tries in a 43-21 win over Scotland at Murrayfield on Saturday, and the second half decided it. Only three points separated the teams at the break, but Scotland failed to score after it, while Josh Moorby, Beauden Barrett (two tries) and Asafo Aumua crossed for the visitors. Ewan Ashman's first-half hat-trick for Scotland was not enough. Peter Lakai and Wallace Sititi both went to the sin-bin in the first half."
        },
